<h2>Urgent help comes from outside this site</h2>
<p>For immediate danger in India, call <a href="tel:112">Emergency 112</a>. For mental-health support, call <a href="tel:14416">Tele-MANAS 14416</a>. Reports here are not an emergency service. Official information: <a href="https://112.gov.in/">112</a> and <a href="https://dghs.mohfw.gov.in/national-mental-health-programme.php">Tele-MANAS</a>.</p>
